Thought: try a per‑horizon softmax weighting on the robust pool4 to capture horizon‑specific strengths while staying within a small subset.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool4","weights":"softmax_neg_error"}

